  "final_text": "The `android.os.NetworkOnMainThreadException` occurred because `CatalogClient().fetchCatalog()` was being executed synchronously on the Android main (UI) thread inside the `load` button's `OnClickListener`.\n\n### Changes Made\nIn [MainActivity.kt](file:///mnt/01DC198BE9192500/github/Schooldev/3S-study-work/trials/e4/c3-agy-B-r5/work/app/src/main/kotlin/vn/shelftap/lab/MainActivity.kt#L25-L35):\n- Used `lifecycleScope.launch` to start a coroutine scoped to the activity's lifecycle.\n- Wrapped the blocking call to `CatalogClient().fetchCatalog()` with `withContext(Dispatchers.IO)` so network I/O executes off the main thread.\n- Assigned the result to `output.text` back on the main thread.\n",
